WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.201
-President Trump

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.903
held a deranged rally
as he became

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.339
the third president in history
to be impeached

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.907
and, now,
Republicans are threatening

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.009
to rig the Senate trial
in Trump's favor.

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:12.245
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:16.982 line:0%
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:20.286
President Trump is now one
of only three presidents

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.054
to be impeached
and his impeachment

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:24.557
is not some sort of misuse
of Congressional powers.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.659
It's exactly what
the framers had in mind

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.295
when they wrote the impeachment
clause into the Constitution.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:33.199
In fact, as Democrats wrote
in their 658-page report

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.767
detailing the evidence
against Trump,

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.202
the president
betrayed the nation

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:39.172
by abusing his high office
to enlist a foreign power

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:41.040
in corrupting
democratic elections.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.310
President Trump has realized
the framers' worst nightmare.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.711
And I think that's true,

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:47.780
both in the metaphorical sense
and also literally.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.116
Back in those days,
people would have nightmares

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.085
about stuff like demons,
vampires, or rubella,

00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:54.687
and Trump looks like all three.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:57.123
[ Laughter ]
He looks like a stowaway

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:58.557
who spent three months hiding

00:00:58.557 --> 00:01:00.660
in a crate
in the bowel of a ship,

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.429
who got bit by a plague rat
and a Dracula.

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:04.931
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.099
And, if you're wondering --

00:01:07.099 --> 00:01:09.201
if you're wondering if Trump
was watching yesterday

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:12.171
as he became the third president
ever in history to be impeached,

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:15.174
GOP Senator Lindsey Graham said,
in a press conference,

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:17.210
he'd been in touch with Trump
throughout the day.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.879
-I talked to him today.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.514
I said, "How you doin'?"
"Well, I'm being impeached.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.015
Other than that,
I'm doin' okay." [laughs]

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:24.851
-So, not okay, then.

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:26.519
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.354
That's like when
you Facetime your grandpa

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:30.089
and, before you can get
a word in,

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:31.924
he bitches about like 14 things.

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:33.092
How are you, Gran--
"Well, you know,

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:35.561
my back is killing me
and I have sciatica

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:37.163
and I need
my inflatable doughnut,

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.131
but I lost it
and I can't find my happy.

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:40.232
You know me.
I don't complain."

00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:41.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.436
And Republicans have insisted

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.738
that Trump is weathering
the storm and pushing forward,

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.840
like GOP Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy,

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.909
who said yesterday
that he met with Trump

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.543
and praised
the president's demeanor.

00:01:51.543 --> 00:01:53.946
-I was with him just yesterday,
down in the White House.

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:57.217
Anybody else, this would be
traumatic for them.

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:59.452
I've never seen a man so strong.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.620
-You've never
seen a man so strong?

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.856
Have you ever watched a movie
with The Rock in it?

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:06.025
[ Laughter and applause ]
Because,

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.460
if you replace The Rock
with Trump,

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.496
they'd have to rename the movies
"The Slow and the Furious."

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:11.764
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:13.867
So, the Republicans say
Trump is holding strong.

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:16.702
In that case, let's see what the
president of the United States

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:19.072
was talking about at his rally
in Michigan last night,

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:21.240
at roughly the same moment
he was becoming

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.175
only the third person
in history to be impeached.

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:26.879
The rally was billed
as a Merry Christmas rally

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:28.046
and, in the spirit
of the season,

00:02:28.046 --> 00:02:29.081
Trump went through a list

00:02:29.081 --> 00:02:31.250
of grievances
and insults so long,

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.286
CNN actually had
to tally up a list

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:35.021
of everyone and everything
he attacked.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.023
Remember, this is what
the president was talking about

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:39.859
as history was being made
in Congress.

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:43.629
-At the moment that the
president was being impeached,

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:45.999
he was holding a Merry Christmas
rally in Michigan,

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.834
a state that he is going
to need to win,

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.936
if he wants to be reelected.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.938
The rally was one
of his longest, ever,

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:54.139
and it was also one
of his angriest.

00:02:54.139 --> 00:02:56.876
This is a list of just
about everyone and everything

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.078
[ Laughter ]
that he attacked
during his two-hour speech.

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:02.748
It includes his usual targets,
like Democrats and the media,

00:03:02.748 --> 00:03:04.817
but also, event security,

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:06.986
for being too polite
to a protester.

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.288
And, in an odd turn,
during what is arguably

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:12.158
the most consequential moment
of his presidency,

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:15.161
the president criticized
dishwashers.

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:17.463
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:20.099
-You know, Christmas stuff.
[laughs, claps]

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:22.201
That's right. The president
attacked security guards,

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:24.236
Democrats, the media,
and dishwashers.

00:03:24.236 --> 00:03:26.071
Normally, when someone
rambles that long,

00:03:26.071 --> 00:03:27.373
you have to take away
their keys.

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:31.144
Now, we're gonna play
the dishwasher rant for you,

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:34.881
but I also wanna show you CNN
anchor Brianna Keilar's reaction

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.582
when they cut back to her
after the clip

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:38.384
because I feel like
her face really captures

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.386
how all of us are feeling.

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:41.687
-Dishwashers.

00:03:41.687 --> 00:03:43.222
We did the dishwasher, right?

00:03:43.222 --> 00:03:44.523
You press it.

00:03:44.523 --> 00:03:45.892
Remember the dishwasher?
You press it,

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.493
boom, there'd be like
an explosion.

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:49.529
[ Laughter ]
Five minutes later,
you open it up,

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:51.431
the steam pours out, the dishes.

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:53.165
Now, you press it 12 times.

00:03:53.165 --> 00:03:54.700
[ Laughter ]
Women tell me --

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.269
Again. You know, they give you
four drops of water

00:03:57.269 --> 00:03:59.371
and they're in places where
there's so much water,

00:03:59.371 --> 00:04:00.473
they don't know what
to do with it!

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:01.674
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:04.643
[ Laughter and applause ]
Yeah.

00:04:04.643 --> 00:04:06.246
Yeah. That's how --

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:07.947
[ Applause ]
That's how I feel, too.

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:10.016
[laughing] That is --
-Ow!

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:13.319
[ Applause ]

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:15.454
That's the face you make
at a dinner party

00:04:15.454 --> 00:04:17.623
when someone tells you
an insane story

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:19.125
that lets you know
they're a weirdo.

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:20.693
"Call me crazy, but, lately,

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:22.729
I've been enjoying
'The Cosby Show' more."

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:25.964
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.964 --> 00:04:27.566
[ Applause ]
Also, let's assess

00:04:27.566 --> 00:04:29.535
Donald Trump's understanding
of dishwashers.

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:31.537
I mean, he clearly
has no idea how they work.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:35.307
There would be an explosion
and steam would pour out?!

00:04:35.307 --> 00:04:38.144
[ Laughter ]
Sounds like he's talking
about a baking soda volcano.

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:41.647
He has never, clearly, never
washed a dish in his life.

00:04:41.647 --> 00:04:43.582
Also, I like how he says,
"Women tell me."

00:04:43.582 --> 00:04:46.252
They probably tell you that
to get away from you.

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:48.453
[as Trump] You wanna see
a solid gold apartment?

00:04:48.453 --> 00:04:51.057
"Um, I'd love to, but,

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:52.824
my dishwasher exploded.

00:04:52.824 --> 00:04:56.129
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:56.129 --> 00:04:57.764
So, I gotta go."

00:04:57.764 --> 00:05:00.266
[ Cheering and applause ]
But, probably,

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:04.170
my favorite moment came right
before that dishwasher rant,

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.572
when Trump was, again,
rambling about lightbulbs,

00:05:06.572 --> 00:05:09.141
garbage dumps, sinks,
and showers, for some reason.

00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:11.777
Even his own fawning admirers

00:05:11.777 --> 00:05:13.913
were just staring
at him in silence.

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:17.950
-When a light bulb is out,
you've gotta bring it to a dump.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.119
So let's say, over here,
in Battle Creek.

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:22.555
Where's your nearest dump?

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:24.457
Okay. That's, what?
A couple a hundred miles away.

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:27.526
So every time you lose --
drive a couple a hundred miles.

00:05:27.526 --> 00:05:29.295
I said,
"How many people do that?"

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:30.362
Nobody.
What do they do?

00:05:30.362 --> 00:05:31.597
They throw it in the garbage.

00:05:31.597 --> 00:05:34.066
But you know what?
It is, 'cause it's all gas.

00:05:34.066 --> 00:05:36.535
It's much more expensive,
four, five, times more.

00:05:36.535 --> 00:05:37.603
And I came into office.

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:39.004
I did a lot of this.

00:05:39.004 --> 00:05:42.341
Sinks, showers,
all of this stuff.

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:43.409
I did a lot of it.

00:05:43.409 --> 00:05:44.577
No water comes out.

00:05:44.577 --> 00:05:46.111
You have areas where
there's so much water,

00:05:46.111 --> 00:05:47.179
you don't know what
to do with it.

00:05:47.179 --> 00:05:48.581
You turn on the shower,

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:50.749
you're not allowed to have
any water anymore.

00:05:50.749 --> 00:05:53.119
[ Laughter ]
-When you're Donald Trump

00:05:53.119 --> 00:05:55.321
and you lose Trump supporters,

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:56.955
you know you're way
out in left field.

00:05:56.955 --> 00:05:58.324
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:58.324 --> 00:05:59.892
I mean, that the is truly one
of the strangest things

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:01.527
I've ever seen.
Thousands of people packed

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:03.562
cheek-to-cheek in an arena,
staring silently

00:06:03.562 --> 00:06:07.600
at a lunatic just rambling
about sinks and showers.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.468
A lunatic who they support.

00:06:09.468 --> 00:06:11.970
[ Laughter ]
That would be like riding
on the subway with a crazy guy

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.907
ranting and raving about how
a roach stole his cigarette

00:06:14.907 --> 00:06:16.675
and then realizing, "Oh, no!

00:06:16.675 --> 00:06:19.278
I have that guy's name
on my hat!"

00:06:19.278 --> 00:06:21.513
[ Laughter ]

00:06:21.513 --> 00:06:23.883
But, eventually,
the crowd did get involved,

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:25.118
in the dumbest way possible.

00:06:25.118 --> 00:06:26.953
When Trump went
on yet another rant

00:06:26.953 --> 00:06:31.390
about how people supposedly have
to flush toilets ten times now

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.958
because of environmental
regulations

00:06:32.958 --> 00:06:35.461
and the crowd shouted out
some of the words.

00:06:35.461 --> 00:06:36.562
-Sinks!

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:38.163
Right?
Showers!

00:06:38.163 --> 00:06:40.433
-And what goes with a sink
and a shower?

00:06:40.433 --> 00:06:42.134
-Toilets!

00:06:42.134 --> 00:06:44.069
[ Laughter ]
-Ten times, right?

00:06:44.069 --> 00:06:47.340
Ten times. Wah, bah.
Not me, of course. Not me.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.275
[ Laughter ]
But you, him.

00:06:49.275 --> 00:06:51.911
-An actual crowd of adults
yelled out the word toilets.

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:54.147
[ Laughter ]
Like kindergartners

00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:55.181
completing a nursery rhyme.

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:56.883
They sound like the audience

00:06:56.883 --> 00:06:58.851
yelling out the answer
on "Family Feud."

00:06:58.851 --> 00:07:00.486
[Southern accent]
Top 5 answers on the board.

00:07:00.486 --> 00:07:02.088
Name something more important
than impeachment.

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:04.990
Show me toilets!
[ Ding ]

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:08.761
[ Laughter and applause ]
Trump was so desperate.

00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:10.362
[ Applause ]

00:07:10.362 --> 00:07:12.832
he was so desperate and insecure
about being impeached,

00:07:12.832 --> 00:07:14.399
he actually tried to deny it

00:07:14.399 --> 00:07:16.669
and told his crowd
it wasn't really happening.

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:18.370
[ Booing ]
-By the way,

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.573
it doesn't really feel like
we're being impeached.

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.808
[ Laughter ]

00:07:22.808 --> 00:07:24.610
-Yeah, we're not!

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.712
[ Laughter ]
You are.

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:28.414
In terms of getting impeached,
the rest of us

00:07:28.414 --> 00:07:30.483
did great yesterday.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:32.150
Also, I love how,
when it's impeachment,

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.919
he's like... [as Trump]
We're all getting impeached.

00:07:33.919 --> 00:07:35.854
But when it's about toilets,
he's like...

00:07:35.854 --> 00:07:38.791
[as Trump] You people probably
take giant ten-flushers.

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:40.092
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:42.127
Not me.

00:07:42.127 --> 00:07:44.196
Then, Trump ripped off
an angry tirade

00:07:44.196 --> 00:07:47.500
where he insisted the Democrats
who won the 2018 midterms

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.835
and got more votes
in the 2016 election

00:07:49.835 --> 00:07:51.703
were trying to nullify
his victory

00:07:51.703 --> 00:07:53.772
and lied about his
sagging poll numbers.

00:07:53.772 --> 00:07:56.308
[ Booing ]
-After three years

00:07:56.308 --> 00:07:59.778
of sinister witch hunts,
hoaxes, scams,

00:07:59.778 --> 00:08:02.414
tonight, the House Democrats
are trying to nullify

00:08:02.414 --> 00:08:05.050
the ballots of tens of millions

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.253
[ Booing ]
of patriotic Americans.

00:08:07.253 --> 00:08:09.722
With today's illegal,
unconstitutional,

00:08:09.722 --> 00:08:12.158
and partisan impeachment...

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:15.627
[ Booing ]
-[Shouts indistinctly]

00:08:15.627 --> 00:08:18.330
-...the do-nothing Democrats --
And they are do-nothing.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.832
All they wanna do is
focus on this.

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:22.868
What they could be doing --
Are declaring

00:08:22.868 --> 00:08:26.271
their deep hatred and disdain
for the American voter.

00:08:26.271 --> 00:08:30.242
[ Booing ]
This lawless,
partisan impeachment

00:08:30.242 --> 00:08:33.912
is a political suicide march
for the Democrat Party.

00:08:33.912 --> 00:08:36.882
Have you seen my polls
in the last four weeks?

00:08:36.882 --> 00:08:38.050
-Have you?

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:40.052
[ Laughter ]
Because a Fox News poll found

00:08:40.052 --> 00:08:41.887
that 50% of people
wanted you impeached

00:08:41.887 --> 00:08:44.156
and removed from office.
And that's a Fox News poll,

00:08:44.156 --> 00:08:45.558
Trump's favorite channel.

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:46.926
There's no way Trump
wasn't watching

00:08:46.926 --> 00:08:48.094
when they showed that poll.

00:08:48.094 --> 00:08:50.129
His aides probably had
to tape over his TV

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:52.898
to make it look like the poll
said 50% think President Trump

00:08:52.898 --> 00:08:55.101
is a big, strong, tough boy
and we love him so much.

00:08:55.101 --> 00:08:58.938
[ Laughter and applause ]
And, now, now,

00:08:58.938 --> 00:09:00.305
in the face of that reality,

00:09:00.305 --> 00:09:01.940
both Fox News
and the Republican Party

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.675
are doing everything
they can to protect Trump.

00:09:03.675 --> 00:09:05.844
And that includes rigging
the Senate impeachment trial

00:09:05.844 --> 00:09:07.312
to kill it
as quickly as possible.

00:09:07.312 --> 00:09:09.748
Now, impeachment
is a huge historical marker

00:09:09.748 --> 00:09:11.517
that will condemn Trump's name
in history forever,

00:09:11.517 --> 00:09:13.586
but removing him
is gonna be a lot harder.

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:15.388
To get rid of Trump,
we're gonna have to flush...

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:17.622
-Ten times, right? Ten times.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:17.622 --> 00:09:18.757
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:09:18.757 --> 00:09:22.528 line:0%
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

